window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>There's only one thing my inner panther and I agree on. This gorgeous woman, whose thighs I'd happily die between, is my mate. And I will protect her at all costs. Ideally, in my bed.</b></p> <p>But my fated mate has a magic that even she doesn't know about. The ability to see into shifters' souls and discover their true nature. And that hidden power puts her in the sights of enemies with mysterious magic of their own.</p> <p>I will never let them hurt her. Even if it costs me everything.</p> <p>Because despite her magic, she doesn't know that shifters exist.</p> <p>And if she finds out the truth about me... she might leave forever. And take my soul with her.</p> <p>Claimed by the Panther<i> is a steamy shifter fantasy romance book featuring a protective panther shifter hero who loves to spoil his fated mate, a heroine with secret magic of her own, and a Cinderella story where the hero has claws and sharp teeth. No cliffhangers!</i></p>"; 
